OL,3,GNEWSAWar memorial statue depicting
OL,4,AJesus vandalised
OL,5,
OL,6,FA war memorial statue depicting Jesus
OL,7,FChrist has been vandalised at a
OL,8,FCatholic church, with police
OL,9,Finvestigating the incident as a hate
OL,10,Fcrime.
OL,12,FCheshire Police said the statue was
OL,13,Fdamaged and daubed with graffiti on
OL,14,FFriday at St Alban's Church in Bewsey,
OL,15,FWarrington.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
