OL,3,GNEWSAWar memorial statue depicting
OL,4,AJesus vandalised
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a video released on the church's
OL,7,FFacebook page, Canon Christopher
OL,8,FCunningham said the head of the figure
OL,9,Fhad been "knocked off" in an incident
OL,10,Fof "true persecution". He said
OL,11,F"offensive language against the
OL,12,FCatholic Church" had been left on the
OL,13,Fstatue's plaque.
OL,15,FThe offensive language has since been
OL,16,Fremoved by a church volunteer.
